      "content": "<p>The shift in the digital age has enabled us to find<a href=\"https://www.kots.world/properties/bengaluru\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp; flats for rent in bangalore</a> in different ways, taking the ease of finding homes, apartments, or vacation rentals online. However, this ease now brings about some issues of its own. Many customers face different kinds of problems while using online rental listing platforms that make way for frustration and disappointment. It is very important to understand these common problems for both renters and platform providers.<br></p><h2><b>Common Issues Customers Face</b></h2><p><b>1. Inadequate Listings<br></b>Most rental platforms experience a really weak listing problem. In most cases, customers find that the information is very poorly presented to decide whether they will make a booking or not. At times, the missing details include the property features, size, and location.</p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"1.896in\"},{\"wt\":\"5.115in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.01in\" data-table-name=\"Table_1\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-dguaeqy5lwbm\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 182.016px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b> Problem Type</b></span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 491.04px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>&nbsp;Description</b></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-60h52qxt6byb\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 182.016px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Missing Information</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 491.04px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Listings often lack essential details.</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-8sryr5o4yrgt\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 182.016px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Duplicate Listings</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 491.04px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Multiple entries for the same property confuse users.</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-uq68goe19sr7\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 182.016px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Poor Data Quality</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 491.04px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Incorrect or outdated information misleads customers.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">To solve this, the platforms must make sure that comprehensive data from credible sources is gathered while keeping regular updates.<br></span><b>2. Poor Listing Data<br></b>Another common problem is poor listing data. This includes incorrect or missing information that can lead to misunderstandings about the property. For instance, if a listing states that a unit has three bedrooms but it only has two, this discrepancy can cause significant frustration.</p><p></p><p><b>3. Outdated Listings</b><br>Most of the users usually come across postings that are not even putting up the real available properties. So, it wastes more time for the potentials and threatens the credibility of the platform when a listing shows that a property is available, but the house has been occupied because it has already been rented.<br></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000757006\" style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline;\">4. Misleading Pricing</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocrurehgb7fses\",\"id\":\"toc_iazt9xvxta9s\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_iazt9xvxta9s\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocrurehgb7fses\",\"id\":\"toc_iazt9xvxta9s\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_iazt9xvxta9s\" style=\"\"><b>&nbsp;<br></b></span>Misleading pricing is another possible problem. In some listings, attractive rental prices are offered, but hidden costs appear while finalizing the transaction. That again frustrates the customers and makes them against the platform.</p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"1.917in\"},{\"wt\":\"5.094in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.01in\" data-table-name=\"Table_2\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-dzga4g671glz\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 184.032px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></font><b style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</b><b>Pricing Issue</b></span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 489.024px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></font><b style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</b><b> </b>&nbsp;<b>Description</b></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-f78k1lct4b0t\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 184.032px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b> </b>&nbsp;</span></font>Hidden Fees</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 489.024px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span></font>&nbsp;Additional costs that are not disclosed upfront.</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-s31kjt06d7p4\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 184.032px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></font><b style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b><b>&nbsp;</b>Fluctuating Prices</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 489.024px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</b>Prices that change frequently without notice.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>5. Low-Quality Visuals<br></b>High-quality images are the best; otherwise, most listings have low-resolution photographs or simply no photographs, making it impossible for an entrant to develop a clear judgment about the condition and appeal of the property.<br><b><br>6. Slow Response Times</b><br>When renters express interest in a property, they expect timely responses from landlords or agents. Unfortunately, many platforms suffer from slow response times, which can lead to missed opportunities and frustrated customers.<br><br><b>7. High Fees and Commissions<br></b>Online rental platforms charge huge fees and colossal commissions on transactions. These costs might deter the prospective renter as he believes that he is overpaying for services which ought to be very much less costly.<br><br><b>8. Security Concerns</b><br>A much worse issue is that fraudulent activities exist prominently on rental platforms. The customers get hoodwinked by these fake listings, which promise some great deals but turn out to be a scam.</p><p><b>9.Duplicate pictures or ads</b><br>Users may post their ads repeatedly in order to top the lists, which leads to multiple copies of an ad. That doesn't go very well for user experience and could be lousy for SEO too.<br>The apartment featured in the ad is also not real if there's a duplicated picture. For instance, if one has used the stock photo or has stolen the picture from another listing, this becomes a good reason to be suspicious while reviewing an ad as it is highly suspicious for the advertiser not to have a picture of the place they are selling or letting.</p><p><b>10.Referral or contact detail schemes<br></b>For instance, some of the people advertising would list the already existing houses because of their realtor <a href=\"https://www.luxurypresence.com/blogs/real-estate-referral-fees/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">referral fee</a>. Other instances include listed properties that are not even real placed in the market to collect contact information of the possible tenants/buyers to sell them to con artists that exploit such information or to real estate agencies as leads.<br>The more grey-zone version of this practice is when agencies post first-class properties at a great price that always end up selling just before the potential tenant/buyer gets in touch. This way, the agency collects details of interested parties and can then present similar properties at a slightly higher cost.<br>Some problems plaguing the real estate category are more harmful than others, but they all have at least one thing in common: they harm the user experience. The first step in fighting these issues is understanding what's present on your site and how they manifest themselves. The next step, of course, is figuring out how to deal with them.<br></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000757006\" style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">11. Poor User Experience</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocj2xnto5ehuhk\",\"id\":\"toc_yc9qizkus83i\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_yc9qizkus83i\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocj2xnto5ehuhk\",\"id\":\"toc_yc9qizkus83i\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_yc9qizkus83i\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The rental platform's design and functionality are highly reliant on the user experience. Websites that are hard to navigate or take too long to load can be frustrating and help to drive users away.</span></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"2.25in\"},{\"wt\":\"4.771in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.02in\" data-table-name=\"Table_3\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-n559aokrap7c\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 216px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>&nbsp; User Experience Issue&nbsp;</b></span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 458.016px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Impact</b></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-o4cshfqbbycc\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 216px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Complicated Navigation</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 458.016px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Users struggle to find relevant listings easily.</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-qu15fzqnaane\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 216px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Slow Loading Times</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 458.016px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Increased bounce rates as users leave in frustration.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>",
