      "content": "<h2><b>Solutions to Common Issues</b></h2><p><b>Improving Data Quality<br></b>The mere existence of low-quality listings or poor-quality data necessitates systematic efforts towards data cleaning. Improvements and validation of the data brought into the platform are critical to this end, through accuracy.<br><b>Regular Updates and Maintenance<br></b>Platforms ought to develop a routine of checking and updating the listings so that obsolete information is expunged promptly.<br><b>Transparent Pricing Models<br></b>It will increase trust from users, as it makes pricing clear without any other hidden charges.<br><b>Enhancing Visual Content<br></b>Good professional photography and virtual tours could add a lot to listings.<br><b>Streamlining Communication</b><br>Message systems should be placed in a central place, ensuring the renters and landlords communicate with each other effectively and make timely responses.</p>",
